Package: flexIC
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Rank-Preserving Correlation Engine
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Kevin", "Wells", email = "kevin.e.wells@usm.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a fast, flexible method for simulating continuous
    variables with specified rank correlations using the Iman–Conover
    transformation (Iman & Conover, 1982 <doi:10.1080/03610918208812265>)
    and back-ranking. Includes plotting tools and error-diagnostics.
